# This repo is public, and these hold real account data — account numbers,
# balances, position sizes. settings.local.json in particular accumulates
# allowlisted command strings, and the commands this agent runs quote live
# positions back verbatim. A machine-level ignore covers it here but does
# not travel with a clone, so the rule belongs in the repo too.
.claude/settings.local.json
*.local.json
positions*.json
eqpos*.json
backup*.json
